{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "1788975169000-35e9ae", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "OA 里报销审批流怎么设置分级？", "id": "331721841e814278bc2b86db33a887e5", "created_at": "2026-09-09T17:32:49", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "206c919d5a884dc59b22e0e2c4624fd1", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-09T17:32:49", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "理解用户诉求后，结合公司数据与制度作答，保持简洁准确。", "id": "5caddcb9b13f4a01b92d11a74b4e4993", "created_at": "2026-09-09T17:32:57", "finished_at": "2026-09-09T17:33:29"}, {"type": "text", "text": "建议三级：\n- ≤1,000 元：部门经理 → 财务\n- 1,000–10,000 元：部门经理 → 分管负责人 → 财务\n- >10,000 元：部门经理 → 分管负责人 → 总经理 → 财务\n差旅报销固定加一级「行程合规检查」（人事/行政），防止事后扯皮。", "id": "88a8463aa2f34eb7b5c1e3678e5d40e4", "created_at": "2026-09-09T17:32:57", "finished_at": "2026-09-09T17:33:29"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "fb31368dc8ea47969e31f42f84c18656", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-09T17:32:57", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-09T17:33:29", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "审批人出差怎么设置代批？", "id": "aa6768d8eaf44abe8c4c7648897cf1c1", "created_at": "2026-09-09T17:34:49", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "835d9a918acf4ec983bfb0e0817b338e", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-09T17:34:49", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "理解用户诉求后，结合公司数据与制度作答，保持简洁准确。", "id": "4ca25b8425e446e89b283ba02ca56239", "created_at": "2026-09-09T17:34:57", "finished_at": "2026-09-09T17:35:29"}, {"type": "text", "text": "OA 后台-流程管理-代理规则：设置出差期间代理人（同部门或上级），代理审批需备注「代批」；紧急事项可走企微离线审批（短信兜底），回来后在 OA 补确认。", "id": "94af0242986b4415be88d48b81af1f54", "created_at": "2026-09-09T17:34:57", "finished_at": "2026-09-09T17:35:29"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "c1c822b1d47148d8aa79a8e1d4a765b0", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-09T17:34:57", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-09T17:35:29", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "代批的责任算谁的？", "id": "a8b85f87f22544da837f895d441a5d4e", "created_at": "2026-09-09T17:38:29", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "5b1503316e9c43d69d9be7ed5c6a4b38", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-09T17:38:29", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "5a92358e390c4711b8c72310ad30a362", "created_at": "2026-09-09T17:38:35", "finished_at": "2026-09-09T17:39:14"}, {"type": "text", "text": "算代理人的责任——签了字就要负责，所以代批人只能批自己权限内的，超出权限的应转交并说明。OA 里代理规则设置时限定「同级别或以上」就是这个原因。", "id": "43ddbf3e872a45a0a06dda26ee381112", "created_at": "2026-09-09T17:38:35", "finished_at": "2026-09-09T17:39:14"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "bc3c7818288d40359f8da1b18a65b50e", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-09T17:38:35", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-09T17:39:14", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}], "reply_context": {}, "permission_context": {}, "tool_context": {}, "tasks_context": {}, "middle_context": {}}}}